# EXPRESS-006 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:6  (starts with products p1 … p8)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@host = http://localhost:3000

### Search name or tags (expect 200, p5 p6 p8)
GET {{host}}/products?q=camp

### Search ignores case and spaces (expect 200, p1 p2)
GET {{host}}/products?q=%20%20SHOES%20%20

### Price range (expect 200, p3 p6)
GET {{host}}/products?minPrice=4000&maxPrice=9000

### Search + price (expect 200, p5 p6)
GET {{host}}/products?q=camp&maxPrice=9000

### Invalid price (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/products?minPrice=-1

### minPrice bigger than maxPrice (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/products?minPrice=5000&maxPrice=1000
